The upstream changepoint 2.3 DESCRIPTION declares:

    License: GPL

without a version qualifier. This translation preserves that declaration rather
than silently choosing a different license. Standard GPL version 2 and GPL
version 3 texts are included for convenience and provenance because R package
licensing documentation treats an unversioned "GPL" declaration as ambiguous.
Nothing in this note is intended to narrow or expand rights granted by the
upstream copyright holders.

See upstream/DESCRIPTION and NOTICE.md.
